Z||000006||Formula||07-30-2001||06:56 AM||||have you ever seen those posted speedlimit signs.  Why would you want a V8 to go the same speed on a public road and get 15 mpg when you could have a 4 cyl get 40 mpg and go the exact same speed.  <P>Some people like to go the speedlimit..<P>Some people can't afford 15 mpg<P>Some people cant afford a V8<P>Subaru Rally Cars are 4 cyl<P>The SD4 was a 4 cyl, almost 3 liters but a 4<P>A stock civic vtec would blow the doors off most stock 100k mile V6 fieros..... why, it revs up to make the power and has better gearing.  Age comes into play with this one.<P>I know its dumb to battle with someone unprepared but Im defending the duke owners.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigformulagt.jpg"> ||||reg||1
